                          P99 Latency &lt; 15.0 ms<br>
                          WAN Pkts = 0<br>
                          Circuit Breaker: CLOSED
                        </td>
                        <td style="padding: 12px; color: #39ff14; font-weight: 600;">
                          &bull; Verified Stable (Zero-Egress &bull; Sub-ms)<br>
