                        <span>🔍 Inspect in Admin Viewer</span>
                      </button>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <pre style="margin: 0; padding: 0.85rem; background: #030712; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 6px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; color: #38bdf8; overflow-x: auto;"><code># Inspect real-time Raft Quorum status, WAL term, and peer latency
