              <!-- =========================================================================
                   5. Turnkey Migration Recipes Architecture & Dynamic Population Engine
                   ========================================================================= -->
              <div id="admin-turnkey-recipes-architecture" style="margin-bottom: 3rem; background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.95), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.92)); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.75rem; box-shadow: 0 10px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);">
                <!-- Header Banner -->
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem;">
                  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.65rem;">
                    <span style="font-size: 1.5rem;">🛠️</span>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; margin: 0;">
                      5. Turnkey Migration Recipes Architecture &amp; Dynamic Population Engine
                    </h3>
                  </div>
                  <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); color: #34d399; border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4); font-weight: 700; font-family: var(--font-mono);">SPEC-TURNKEY-RECIPES-001</span>
                    <span style="font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); color: #38bdf8; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); font-weight: 700; font-family: var(--font-mono);">10 RECIPES ACTIVE</span>
                    <span style="font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15); color: #c084fc; border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3); font-weight: 700; font-family: var(--font-mono);">DYNAMIC AUTO-DISCOVERY</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                  In <span class="dcouplr-brand-tag"><span class="tag-bracket">&lt;</span><span class="tag-name">dcouplr</span><span class="tag-bracket">/&gt;</span></span>, a <strong>Recipe</strong> (formally: <em>Turnkey Migration Recipe</em>) is a modular, self-contained modernization blueprint. It encapsulates the source AST parser, intermediate directed acyclic graph (UIT-IR DAG), and target cloud emitter required to convert vendor DSLs (Datadog, New Relic, CloudWatch, Azure Monitor, F5 BIG-IP, Terraform) into open standards (Grafana 11, Prometheus, OpenTofu, Anycast ALBs) with <strong>100% deterministic mathematical parity</strong> (&Phi;(q) &equiv; &Psi;(Target)) and <strong>$0.00 WAN egress</strong>.
                </p>

                <!-- Core Governance Grid: What are Recipes & How are they Populated -->
                <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.75rem;">
                  <!-- Box 1: What is a Recipe -->
                  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.2rem;">
                    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
                      <span style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #38bdf8;">📦</span>
                      <h4 style="font-size: 0.98rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; margin: 0;">Anatomy of a Recipe Bundle</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0.6rem;">
                      Every recipe resides in <code>recipes/&lt;recipe_id&gt;/</code> as an air-gapped bundle containing metadata, verified samples, and executable transpilation scripts:
                    </p>
                    <div style="background: #030712; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.5;">
                      <div>📄 <strong>recipe.json:</strong> ID, vendors, category, and metadata</div>
                      <div>📖 <strong>README.md:</strong> Architecture, requirements &amp; CLI guide</div>
                      <div>📥 <strong>input_*.*:</strong> Sanitized legacy vendor input (JSON/HCL)</div>
                      <div>📤 <strong>output_*.*:</strong> Formally proven cloud-native target</div>
                      <div>⚙️ <strong>migrate.py:</strong> Executable in-VPC AST translation engine</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Box 2: The 3 Population Engines -->
                  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.2rem;">
                    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
                      <span style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #34d399;">⚙️</span>
                      <h4 style="font-size: 0.98rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; margin: 0;">The 3 Population Engines</h4>
                    </div>
                    <ul style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2rem;">
                      <li><strong>1. Disk Auto-Discovery (<code>GET /v1/recipes</code>):</strong> Dynamically scans the <code>recipes/</code> filesystem on boot and request, parsing <code>recipe.json</code> and sample assets with zero external DB dependencies.</li>
                      <li><strong>2. Dynamic Registration API (<code>POST /v1/recipes/register</code>):</strong> SREs dynamically publish custom internal corporate recipes, persisting manifests and code into the live catalog.</li>
                      <li><strong>3. 1-Click Studio Population:</strong> The Compiler Studio UI (<code>/compiler</code>) fetches the catalog and injects sample inputs into the editor in &lt;15ms.</li>
                    </ul>
                  </div>
                </div>

