                          <span class="brand-badge" style="background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.15); color: #39ff14; border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.4); font-size: 0.7rem;">7 Layers &bull; 22 Components &bull; 111 Invariants</span>
