                  <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                    Monitors technology installations directly on bare-metal and VPC nodes (Oracle RAC, PostgreSQL, MySQL, Kafka, Redis, Nginx, JVM, SAP HANA, Ceph, Kubernetes Kubelet) with deep metric evaluation against mathematical thresholds. Natively integrates with the <strong>VARINULL Operations Engine (VOE)</strong> enterprise SaaS platform (ServiceNow &amp; Jira class) via its in-perimeter <strong>Edge Receiver Component</strong> located at <code>varinullOperationsEngine</code> (Port 9000 &amp; local atomic spool) using a <strong>Minimal Connectivity / Full Coverage</strong> paradigm (100% in-perimeter loopback socket, sub-1.5 KB payload, automatic air-gapped local spool fallback, SHA-256 cryptographic attestation, and dual-direction ticket lifecycle sync).
                  </p>

                  <!-- 4-Pillar Grid -->
                  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(270px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                    <!-- Pillar 1 -->
                    <div style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem;">
                      <div style="font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 700; color: #c084fc; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px;">🖥️ Node Technology Census</div>
                      <div style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 6px;">24 Enterprise Stacks</div>
                      <p style="font-size: 0.76rem; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;">
                        Autonomous eBPF process, socket table, and systemd introspection. Monitors SGA hit ratio, Kafka lag velocity, Redis fragmentation, JVM GC pause P99, and WAL rates.
                      </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Pillar 2 -->
                    <div style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.3); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem;">
                      <div style="font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 700; color: #39ff14; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px;">🛡️ Minimal Connectivity</div>
                      <div style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 6px;">Zero Public Cloud Egress</div>
