                        If the VOE socket is offline or severed, <span class="dcouplr-brand-tag"><span class="tag-bracket">&lt;</span><span class="tag-name">dcouplr</span><span class="tag-bracket">/&gt;</span></span> transparently persists the incident into <code>./data/voe_spool/</code> using atomic filesystem renames (<code>.tmp</code> &rarr; <code>.json</code>).
                      </p>
