<!-- 🔌 8.5 Universal Notification Forwarding & Alert Connector Engineering Dossier -->
                <div id="admin-notification-connectors-dossier" style="margin-bottom: 3rem; background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96), rgba(11, 17, 32, 0.94)); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.45); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.75rem; box-shadow: 0 10px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);">
                  <!-- Header Banner -->
                  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 0.85rem; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem;">
                    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.65rem;">
                      <span style="font-size: 1.5rem;">🔌</span>
                      <h3 style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; margin: 0;">
                        8.5 Universal Notification Forwarding &amp; Alert Connector Engineering Dossier
                      </h3>
                    </div>
                    <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                      <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4); padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 4px;">
                        20 ENTERPRISE CONNECTORS &bull; CHATOPS &bull; ON-CALL &bull; ITSM &bull; CLOUD SINKS &bull; SIEM &bull; ZERO-WAN SPOOL
                      </span>
                      <a href="/configuration" target="_blank" style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; background: #38bdf8; color: #000; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none;">
                        ⚙️ Configure Connectors Hub ↗
                      </a>
                      <a href="/docs#alert-routing-guide" target="_blank" style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.15); border: 1px solid #39ff14; color: #39ff14; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none;">
                        📖 Customer Integration Guide ↗
                      </a>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                    Authoritative architecture for outward alert notifications, incident ticket provisioning, and compliance log forwarding. Operates according to the exact wire protocols, authentication specifications, and payload schemas established by industry leaders: <strong>Slack</strong> (Block Kit v2 &amp; Bot OAuth), <strong>Microsoft Teams</strong> (Power Automate Adaptive Cards v1.5), <strong>PagerDuty</strong> (Events API v2 <code>/v2/enqueue</code>), <strong>ServiceNow</strong> (REST Table API <code>/api/now/table/incident</code>), <strong>Jira Service Management</strong> (Atlassian REST v3), <strong>Opsgenie</strong> (Alert API v2), <strong>Email SMTP</strong> (RFC 5321 STARTTLS), <strong>Syslog Relay</strong> (RFC 5424 SIEM), <strong>Generic Webhook</strong> (HMAC-SHA256), and the flagship <strong>VARINULL Operations Desk / Engine (VOE)</strong>.
                  </p>

                  <!-- 4 Architecture Pillars -->
                  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                    <div style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem;">
                      <div style="font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px;">📡 Multi-Channel Dispatch Pipeline</div>
                      <div style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 6px;">Asynchronous Thread Pool</div>
                      <p style="font-size: 0.76rem; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;">
                        Alert evaluation never stalls metric sampling or invariant parsing. Notifications fan out across a non-blocking thread pool capped at 3.0-second timeouts per endpoint.
                      </p>
                    </div>

                    <div style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.3); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem;">
                      <div style="font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 700; color: #39ff14; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px;">🛡️ Zero-Data-Loss Failover Spool</div>
                      <div style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 6px;">Atomic Local Disk Quorum</div>
                      <p style="font-size: 0.76rem; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;">
                        If third-party APIs return HTTP 429, 5xx, or network paths disconnect, notifications are written atomically to <code>./data/alerts_spool/</code> and <code>./data/voe_spool/</code> without drops.
                      </p>
                    </div>

                    <div style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem;">
                      <div style="font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 700; color: #c084fc; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px;">🔏 Cryptographic Attestation</div>
                      <div style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 6px;">Deterministic SHA-256 Signatures</div>
                      <p style="font-size: 0.76rem; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;">
                        Each alert dispatch generates an immutable <code>attestation_hash</code> (SHA-256 of timestamp, alert ID, node ID, and severity) verifiable in SOC 2 / ISO 27001 audit streams.
                      </p>
                    </div>

                    <div style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem;">
                      <div style="font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 700; color: #f59e0b; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px;">🔒 Zero Credential Leaks</div>
                      <div style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 6px;">In-Memory Masked Secrets</div>
                      <p style="font-size: 0.76rem; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;">
                        API tokens, passwords, and webhook secrets are masked in memory and logs. Webhook requests support HMAC-SHA256 signature verification headers.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Complete Engineering Specifications Table -->
                  <div style="background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                    <div style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #fff; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
                      <span>Authoritative Connector Connectivity &amp; Wire Protocol Specifications</span>
                      <span style="font-size: 0.72rem; color: #38bdf8; font-family: var(--font-mono);">RFC 5321 &bull; RFC 5424 &bull; HTTPS REST &bull; IPC Loopback</span>
                    </div>
                    <div style="overflow-x: auto;">
                      <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.78rem; text-align: left;">
                        <thead>
