                  <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
                    <span class="dcouplr-brand-tag"><span class="tag-bracket">&lt;</span><span class="tag-name">dcouplr</span><span class="tag-bracket">/&gt;</span></span> decouples database reliability engineering from brittle vendor point-release schemas. By defining SRE health across mathematical invariants (buffer cache hit ratios &gt;95%, connection pool saturation &lt;80%, replication lag, and transaction deadlocks), the <span class="dcouplr-wordmark"><span class="dcouplr-bracket">&lt;</span><span class="dcouplr-text">dcouplr</span><span class="dcouplr-bracket">/&gt;</span></span> universal telemetry engine supports all database versions without requiring agent updates.
                  </p>

                  <!-- 8 Engine Matrix Table -->
                  <div style="background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
