                  <!-- Detailed Module Breakdown (Two Cards) -->
                  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(360px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2.25rem;">
                    
                    <!-- Module 1: Migration Suite Deep Dive -->
                    <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
                      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                        <span style="font-size: 1.25rem;">🏢</span>
                        <h4 style="font-size: 1.08rem; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; font-family: var(--font-mono); margin: 0;">
                          1. <span class="dcouplr-wordmark"><span class="dcouplr-bracket">&lt;</span><span class="dcouplr-text">dcouplr</span><span class="dcouplr-bracket">/&gt;</span></span> Migration Suite
                        </h4>
                      </div>
                      <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0 0 1rem 0; line-height: 1.55;">
                        <strong>Core Purpose:</strong> Risk-free, deterministic cloud migration, schema transpilation, and zero-downtime cutover.<br>
                        <strong>Operational Mode:</strong> Transactional, project-driven, and active during infrastructure refactoring and cutover windows.
                      </p>

                      <h5 style="font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: #38bdf8; font-family: var(--font-mono); margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Key Capabilities &amp; Modules:</h5>
                      <ul style="font-size: 0.81rem; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.6; padding-left: 1.2rem; margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;">
                        <li><strong>Living AST Compiler Studio (<a href="/compiler" target="_blank" style="color: #38bdf8; text-decoration: underline;">/compiler</a>):</strong> Instant cross-compilation of Terraform, CloudFormation, Bicep, Helm, and raw SQL/SPL.</li>
                        <li><strong>In-Memory Sanitizer:</strong> Strips hardcoded secrets, IAM credentials, and PII from IaC templates before transpilation.</li>
                        <li><strong>CDC State Relocation Engine:</strong> Continuous data replication with zero downtime and binary checksum verification.</li>
                        <li><strong>Staged Cutover Enabler (<a href="/stage-migration" target="_blank" style="color: #38bdf8; text-decoration: underline;">/stage-migration</a> &bull; <a href="/liftnshift" target="_blank" style="color: #38bdf8; text-decoration: underline;">/liftnshift</a>):</strong> Pre-flight synchronization, canary routing, and rollback mechanisms.</li>
                      </ul>

                      <div style="background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.85rem; font-size: 0.77rem; color: #94a3b8; font-family: var(--font-mono); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                        <div>👤 <strong>Buyer Persona:</strong> Migration Architects, Lead DevOps, SIs, Modernization Taskforces</div>
                        <div style="margin-top: 4px;">💼 <strong>Procurement Budget:</strong> Project CapEx, Cloud Migration Budgets, Professional Services</div>
                      </div>

                      <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                        <a href="/compiler" target="_blank" style="padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 0.75rem; border-radius: 5px; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35); color: #38bdf8; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700;">⚡ Open Compiler Studio</a>
                        <a href="/liftnshift" target="_blank" style="padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 0.75rem; border-radius: 5px; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35); color: #38bdf8; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700;">📋 Open Lift &amp; Shift</a>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Module 2: Full-Stack Suite Deep Dive -->
                    <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.25); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
                      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                        <span style="font-size: 1.25rem;">🚀</span>
                        <h4 style="font-size: 1.08rem; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; font-family: var(--font-mono); margin: 0;">
                          2. <span class="dcouplr-wordmark"><span class="dcouplr-bracket">&lt;</span><span class="dcouplr-text">dcouplr</span><span class="dcouplr-bracket">/&gt;</span></span> Full-Stack Suite
                        </h4>
                      </div>
                      <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0 0 1rem 0; line-height: 1.55;">
                        <strong>Core Purpose:</strong> Permanent 24x7 in-VPC monitoring, zero-egress telemetry, distributed consensus, and incident response.<br>
                        <strong>Operational Mode:</strong> Permanent, continuous, running in volatile memory ring buffers across all VPCs with $0 WAN egress.
                      </p>

                      <h5 style="font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: #34d399; font-family: var(--font-mono); margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Key Capabilities &amp; Modules:</h5>
                      <ul style="font-size: 0.81rem; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.6; padding-left: 1.2rem; margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;">
                        <li><strong>7-Tier Full-Stack Monitoring Matrix (<a href="/matrix" target="_blank" style="color: #34d399; text-decoration: underline;">/matrix</a>):</strong> 127 invariant checks spanning Physical DC, OS, Mesh, Consensus, Apps, DBs, and SIEM.</li>
                        <li><strong>Operational Command Centers:</strong> Live SRE Dashboard (<a href="/dashboard" target="_blank" style="color: #34d399; text-decoration: underline;">/dashboard</a>), 24x7 Wallboard (<a href="/wallboard" target="_blank" style="color: #34d399; text-decoration: underline;">/wallboard</a>), Air-Gapped Kiosk (<a href="/kiosk" target="_blank" style="color: #34d399; text-decoration: underline;">/kiosk</a>), 2-Way NOC Desk (<a href="/NOCDesk" target="_blank" style="color: #34d399; text-decoration: underline;">/NOCDesk</a>), and SRE Incident Desk (<a href="/SREDesk" target="_blank" style="color: #34d399; text-decoration: underline;">/SREDesk</a>).</li>
                        <li><strong>Distributed Raft Consensus Engine:</strong> Multi-node leader election, dynamic quorum membership, and automated split-brain prevention.</li>
                        <li><strong>In-VPC OpenTelemetry &amp; Observability:</strong> High-throughput in-guest Log Search (<a href="/logs" target="_blank" style="color: #34d399; text-decoration: underline;">/logs</a>) and Distributed APM Tracing (<a href="/traces" target="_blank" style="color: #34d399; text-decoration: underline;">/traces</a>) with zero cloud egress.</li>
                        <li><strong>Enterprise Observability Co-Existence:</strong> Enriched multi-sink dual-dispatch to Splunk HEC, Syslog SIEM relays, PagerDuty, and ServiceNow.</li>
                      </ul>

                      <div style="background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.85rem; font-size: 0.77rem; color: #94a3b8; font-family: var(--font-mono); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                        <div>👤 <strong>Buyer Persona:</strong> VP of Engineering, VP of Infrastructure &amp; Ops, SRE Directors, CISOs</div>
                        <div style="margin-top: 4px;">💼 <strong>Procurement Budget:</strong> Permanent Annual OpEx (slashing Datadog/Splunk bills by 70%–85%)</div>
                      </div>

                      <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                        <a href="/matrix" target="_blank" style="padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 0.75rem; border-radius: 5px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.4); color: #34d399; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700;">📊 Open 7-Tier Matrix</a>
                        <a href="/dashboard" target="_blank" style="padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 0.75rem; border-radius: 5px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.4); color: #34d399; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700;">⚡ SRE Command Center</a>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                  </div>

                  <!-- Side-by-Side Comparison Matrix Table -->
                  <div style="margin-bottom: 2.25rem;">
                    <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; font-family: var(--font-mono); margin: 0 0 0.85rem 0;">
                      3. Side-by-Side Comparison Matrix
