                    <strong style="color: #c084fc; font-size: 0.95rem;">Database 1: <span class="dcouplr-wordmark"><span class="dcouplr-bracket">&lt;</span><span class="dcouplr-text">dcouplr</span><span class="dcouplr-bracket">/&gt;</span></span> Central DB</strong>
                  </div>
                  <span style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2); color: #e9d5ff; border: 1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.4);">
                    dcouplr_central_db
                  </span>
                </div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.76rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.4;">
                  <strong>Owner:</strong> <span class="dcouplr-wordmark"><span class="dcouplr-bracket">&lt;</span><span class="dcouplr-text">dcouplr</span><span class="dcouplr-bracket">/&gt;</span></span> Corporation (Multi-Tenant Management Plane)<br>
                  <strong>Recommended Engine:</strong> <span style="color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700;">PostgreSQL 14+ / AWS Aurora PostgreSQL</span>
                </div>
                <div style="background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.74rem; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.45;">
                  <strong style="color: #c084fc;">Technical Justification &amp; Fit:</strong>
                  <ul style="margin: 0.35rem 0 0 1.2rem; padding: 0;">
                    <li><strong>ACID Serializable Transactions:</strong> Guarantees zero race conditions during customer license allocations and seat expansion.</li>
                    <li><strong>JSONB Dynamic Schemas:</strong> Houses variable enterprise SLAs, module entitlements, and contract terms with GIN indexing.</li>
                    <li><strong>Row-Level Security (RLS):</strong> Cryptographically isolated multi-tenant commercial data boundary.</li>
                    <li><strong>Zero Access:</strong> Cannot read, query, or receive in-VPC customer telemetry ($0.00 egress).</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div id="central-db-stats" style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                  <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 90px; background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.25); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 10px; text-align: center;">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.68rem; color: #a5b4fc; text-transform: uppercase;">Customers</span>
                    <div id="stat-central-cust" style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff;">3</div>
                  </div>
                  <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 90px; background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.25); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 10px; text-align: center;">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.68rem; color: #a5b4fc; text-transform: uppercase;">Contracts</span>
                    <div id="stat-central-contracts" style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff;">3</div>
                  </div>
                  <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 90px; background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.25); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 10px; text-align: center;">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.68rem; color: #a5b4fc; text-transform: uppercase;">Product SKUs</span>
                    <div id="stat-central-skus" style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff;">4</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Database 2: Customer In-VPC DB -->
              <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.35); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.25rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                    <span style="font-size: 1.25rem;">🛡️</span>
                    <strong style="color: #39ff14; font-size: 0.95rem;">Database 2: Customer In-VPC SSoT DB</strong>
                  </div>
                  <span style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.15); color: #39ff14; border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.35);">
                    dcouplr_customer_db
                  </span>
                </div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.76rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.4;">
                  <strong>Owner:</strong> Customer Enterprise (100% In-Perimeter Sovereign Deployment)<br>
                  <strong>Recommended Engine:</strong> <span style="color: #39ff14; font-weight: 700;">SQLite 3 in WAL Mode (with optional SQLCipher)</span>
                </div>
                <div style="background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.74rem; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.45;">
                  <strong style="color: #39ff14;">Technical Justification &amp; Fit:</strong>
                  <ul style="margin: 0.35rem 0 0 1.2rem; padding: 0;">
                    <li><strong>Microsecond In-Process Latency:</strong> Ingests 25,000+ metrics/sec directly in RAM without TCP socket context switches.</li>
                    <li><strong>Zero Open Network Ports:</strong> No listening daemon on port 5432/3306—100% immune to subnet scans and brute force.</li>
                    <li><strong>Strict $0.00 WAN Egress:</strong> 100% of telemetry, logs, and traces remain on customer NVMe/EBS volumes.</li>
                    <li><strong>100% OS Agnostic:</strong> Native execution across Linux, Windows Server, macOS, Docker, and air-gapped kiosks.</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div id="customer-db-stats" style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                  <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 75px; background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.2); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center;">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.66rem; color: #86efac; text-transform: uppercase;">VPCs / DCs</span>
                    <div id="stat-cust-vpcs" style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff;">4</div>
                  </div>
                  <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 75px; background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.2); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center;">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.66rem; color: #86efac; text-transform: uppercase;">Nodes</span>
                    <div id="stat-cust-nodes" style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff;">71</div>
                  </div>
                  <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 75px; background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.2); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center;">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.66rem; color: #86efac; text-transform: uppercase;">Tiers</span>
                    <div id="stat-cust-tiers" style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff;">7</div>
                  </div>
                  <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 75px; background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.2); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center;">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.66rem; color: #86efac; text-transform: uppercase;">Metrics SSoT</span>
                    <div id="stat-cust-metrics" style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #39ff14;">127</div>
                  </div>
                  <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 75px; background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.2); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center;">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.66rem; color: #86efac; text-transform: uppercase;">Indicators</span>
                    <div id="stat-cust-indicators" style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8;">10</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- SSoT Data Explorer Sub-Tabs -->
            <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.65); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); padding-bottom: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;">
                <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;" id="ssot-tab-bar">
                  <button type="button" class="ssot-sub-tab active" data-subtab="matrix" style="padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.15); color: #39ff14; border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.3);">
                    ⚙️ 7-Tier Invariant Matrix (127 Metrics SSoT)
                  </button>
                  <button type="button" class="ssot-sub-tab" data-subtab="telemetry" style="padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); color: #94a3b8; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);">
                    📊 Core Engine Telemetry (10 Indicators)
                  </button>
                  <button type="button" class="ssot-sub-tab" data-subtab="central" style="padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); color: #94a3b8; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);">
                    🏢 Central DB Enterprise Directory
                  </button>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center;">
                  <button type="button" id="btn-open-ssot-runbook" style="padding: 5px 12px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2); color: #a5b4fc; border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.35); border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer;">
                    📖 Open SSoT Runbook
                  </button>
                  <button type="button" id="btn-refresh-ssot-data" style="padding: 5px 10px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); color: #e2e8f0; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer;">
                    🔄 Refresh SSoT
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Sub-Tab Content 1: 7-Tier Invariant Matrix -->
              <div id="ssot-subtab-matrix" class="ssot-subtab-pane">
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                  <span style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: #94a3b8;">
                    Queried directly from In-VPC SQLite SSoT: <code style="color: #39ff14; font-family: var(--font-mono);">monitoring_matrix_metrics</code>
                  </span>
                  <input type="text" id="ssot-metric-search" placeholder="Filter metrics by name or component..." style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 0.75rem; background: #0b1120; color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); border-radius: 5px; width: 260px;">
                </div>
                <div style="max-height: 480px; overflow-y: auto; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 6px;">
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.75rem; text-align: left;">
                    <thead>
                      <tr style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); color: #94a3b8; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 2;">
                        <th style="padding: 8px 12px;">Tier &amp; Component</th>
                        <th style="padding: 8px 12px;">Invariant Metric</th>
                        <th style="padding: 8px 12px;">Current</th>
                        <th style="padding: 8px 12px;">Warning</th>
                        <th style="padding: 8px 12px;">Critical</th>
                        <th style="padding: 8px 12px;">Window</th>
                        <th style="padding: 8px 12px;">Severity</th>
                      </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody id="ssot-matrix-tbody">
                      <tr><td colspan="7" style="padding: 1rem; text-align: center; color: #94a3b8;">Loading 127 matrix invariants from SQLite SSoT...</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                  </table>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Sub-Tab Content 2: Core Telemetry Indicators -->
              <div id="ssot-subtab-telemetry" class="ssot-subtab-pane" style="display: none;">
                <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                  Queried directly from In-VPC SQLite SSoT: <code style="color: #38bdf8; font-family: var(--font-mono);">core_engine_telemetry</code>
                </div>
                <div id="ssot-telemetry-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem;">
                  <!-- Dynamically populated telemetry indicator cards -->
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Sub-Tab Content 3: Central Enterprise Accounts -->
              <div id="ssot-subtab-central" class="ssot-subtab-pane" style="display: none;">
                <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                  Queried directly from Central Database: <code style="color: #c084fc; font-family: var(--font-mono);">customers</code>, <code style="color: #c084fc; font-family: var(--font-mono);">contracts</code>, <code style="color: #c084fc; font-family: var(--font-mono);">product_skus</code>
                </div>
                <div id="ssot-central-content">
                  <!-- Dynamically populated customer contracts and SKUs -->
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer Stats Bar -->
        <div class="security-audit-bar admin-footer-bar">
          <div class="metric-pill-group">
            <div class="metric-pill"><span>Lines:</span> <strong id="stat-doc-lines">0</strong></div>
            <div class="metric-pill"><span>Words:</span> <strong id="stat-doc-words">0</strong></div>
            <div class="metric-pill"><span>Size:</span> <strong id="stat-doc-bytes">0 KB</strong></div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-pill">
            <span>Governance Integrity:</span> <strong id="stat-integrity-status">Verified Non-Signed Gate</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- Create Document Modal Dialog -->
  <dialog id="new-doc-modal" class="modal-dialog">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h3>➕ Store New Project Record Assistant Document</h3>
        <button id="btn-close-modal" class="btn-close" type="button" aria-label="Close dialog">✕</button>
      </div>
      <form id="new-doc-form" method="dialog">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="new-doc-category">Document Category:</label>
          <select id="new-doc-category" required>
            <option value="Project Record Assistant (Governance)">🏛️ Project Record Assistant (Governance)</option>
            <option value="Financial & Commercial Models">💰 Financial & Commercial Models</option>
            <option value="Technical Specifications & Whitepapers">📐 Technical Specifications & Whitepapers</option>
            <option value="Kubernetes & Deployment Manifests">🚀 Kubernetes & Deployment Manifests</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="new-doc-path">Relative File Path:</label>
          <input 
            type="text" 
            id="new-doc-path" 
            placeholder="e.g. ProjectAssistant/phase-5/02-verification.md" 
            required
          >
          <small>Must begin with ProjectAssistant/, docs/, schemas/, or deploy/</small>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="new-doc-content">Initial Markdown Content:</label>
          <textarea 
            id="new-doc-content" 
            rows="10" 
            placeholder="# Document Title&#10;&#10;**Document ID:** VA-DOC-001&#10;**Date:** 2026-10-20&#10;&#10;## Summary&#10;..." 
            required
          ></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="modal-actions">
          <button type="button" id="btn-cancel-modal" class="btn-secondary">Cancel</button>
          <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">💾 Create & Store Document</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </dialog>

  <!-- Toast Notification Container -->
  <div id="toast-container" class="toast-container" aria-live="polite"></div>

  <script src="/static/admin.js?v=20261031_ssot"></script>
</body>
</html>
